s. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Light the path ahead &amp; unleash ancient magic with your spirit companion, Lumi. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Unlock over a dozen abilities to empower you in combat and traversal. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Equip artefacts and equipment to create a unique loadout for your adventure. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Delve into abandoned temples filled with peril and prizes in equal measure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul>","developers":["Arkanpixel"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2468430/header.jpg?t=1756951631","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257151426,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257151426/movie480.mp4?t=1749091057","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257151426/movie_max.mp4?t=1749091057"},"name":"Frogreign - Gameplay Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257151426/a2009488964f743c7722c3ca128e569ecefeed82/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1749091057","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257151426/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1749091057","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257151426/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1749091057"}}],"name":"Frogreign","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel 8th Gen Quad Core or AMD Ryzen Quad Core<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia 450 GTS / Radeon HD 5750 or better<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 10<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additio